orge rr martin saw for the characters  although some of it never did happen now  i'm sure some of you will hate the idea  that i made this video because of how  irrelevant most of this is however i do  hope some of you find this to be as  interesting as i do it's like stepping  into an alternate a song of ice and fire  universe you could almost consider it  the very first fanfiction only it was  written by the man himself now since  almost all of the major threads and  themes stayed the same i do wonder what  that means for daenerys it's obvious  george rr martin already had most of  this story well thought out in his head  considering daenerys is a main character  i wonder if she will still meet the same  fate he initially had in mind for her we  can see a lot of the smaller details are  different but that doesn't mean their  final scenes will be he originally  wanted her to live but maybe he no  longer feels the same way one day i hope  we find out leave me some of your  thoughts on this down below i'm always  interested in seeing what all of you  have to say as always i want to thank  you for watching my video i hope  everyone has a great day bye  [Music]  foreign
 

